{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/text\/init(_:tablename:bundle:comment:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"key","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LocalizedStringKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tableName","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bundle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bundle","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSBundle","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"comment","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StaticString","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12StaticStringV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil)","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"key","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key for a string in the table identified by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tableName"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"tableName","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The name of the string table to search. If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"table in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Localizable.strings"},{"type":"text","text":" file."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"bundle","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The bundle containing the strings file. If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"main bundle."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"comment","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Contextual information about this key-value pair."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this initializer to look for the ","type":"text"},{"code":"key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter in a localization","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"table and display the associated string value in the initialized text","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view. If the initializer can’t find the key in the table, or if no table","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exists, the text view displays the string representation of the key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["Text(\"pencil\") \/\/ Localizes the key if possible, or displays \"pencil\" if not."]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When you initialize a text view with a string literal, the view triggers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this initializer because it assumes you want the string localized, even","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when you don’t explicitly specify a table, as in the above example. If","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you haven’t provided localization for a particular string, you still get","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reasonable behavior, because the initializer displays the key, which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"typically contains the unlocalized string.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you initialize a text view with a string variable rather than a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"string literal, the view triggers the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Text\/init(_:)-9d1g4","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"initializer instead, because it assumes that you don’t want localization","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in that case. If you do want to localize the value stored in a string","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"variable, you can choose to call the ","type":"text"},{"code":"init(_:tableName:bundle:comment:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"initializer by first creating a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey"},{"text":" instance from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"string variable:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["Text(LocalizedStringKey(someString)) \/\/ Localizes the contents of `someString`."]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you have a string literal that you don’t want to localize, use the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text\/init(verbatim:)"},{"text":" initializer instead.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Styling localized strings with markdown","anchor":"Styling-localized-strings-with-markdown"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the localized string or the fallback key contains Markdown, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view displays the text with appropriate styling. For example, consider","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an app with the following entry in its Spanish localization file:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["\"_Please visit our [website](https:\/\/www.example.com)._\" = \"_Visita nuestro [sitio web](https:\/\/www.example.com)._\";"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can create a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Text","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view with the Markdown-formatted base language","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"version of the string as the localization key, like this:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["Text(\"_Please visit our [website](https:\/\/www.example.com)._\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When viewed in a Spanish locale, the view uses the Spanish text from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"strings file, applying the Markdown styling.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"Text","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" doesn’t render all styling possible in Markdown. It","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t support line breaks, soft breaks, or any style of paragraph- or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"block-based formatting like lists, block quotes, code blocks, or tables.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It also doesn’t support the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/AttributeScopes\/FoundationAttributes\/3796122-imageURL","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attribute. Parsing with OpenSwiftUI treats any whitespace in the Markdown","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"string as described by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/AttributedString\/MarkdownParsingOptions\/InterpretedSyntax\/inlineOnlyPreservingWhitespace","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parsing option.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"init","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"LocalizedStringKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tableName","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bundle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bundle","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSBundle","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"comment","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StaticString","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12StaticStringV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?)","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4TextV_9tableName6bundle7commentAcA18LocalizedStringKeyV_SSSgSo8NSBundleCSgs06StaticJ0VSgtcfc","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","roleHeading":"Initializer","title":"init(_:tableName:bundle:comment:)","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a text view that displays localized content identified by a key."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text\/init(_:tableName:bundle:comment:)"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Text/init(_:tableName:bundle:comment:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text\/init(_:tableName:bundle:comment:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Creates a text view that displays localized content identified by a key.","type":"text"}],"title":"init(_:tableName:bundle:comment:)","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LocalizedStringKey"},{"kind":"tex